### Fix 1 — AC-6 Osaurus recovery at launch
`ohyesmlx/cli.py:1067` (`_recover_startup`) and `:1153` (called after the bind, before the launch line).
- Tests: `test_the_app_recovers_an_osaurus_backup_before_the_launch_line`, `test_a_running_osaurus_app_leaves_the_backup_for_the_next_launch`, `test_a_recovery_that_raises_is_one_line_and_the_app_still_serves`, `test_a_recovery_that_does_not_verify_is_one_line_and_keeps_the_backup`, `test_an_orphan_stop_that_raises_is_one_line_and_the_app_still_serves` (all in `tests/test_cli.py`).
