### Fix 2 — AC-6 orphaned engines
`ohyesmlx/runtimes.py:1616`–`1778` (ledger: `_ledger_path`, `_ledger_entries`, `_write_ledger`, `_process_identity`, `_record_running_engine`, `_forget_running_engine`, `_stop_orphan`, `stop_orphaned_engines`), `:2185`–`2195` (`Runtime.start`: `cold_load_s` local, then ledger, then `Handle`), `:1828` (`Handle.stop`).
